Code knobs are properties (plan P3-02): this block snaps to its grid by its
own argument, the next one by none; a rule sets the continuation indent.

```js(snapKerning: true)
const 标题 = "中文与 ASCII 混排的一行代码足够长，在窄版心下需要折行并对齐到网格";
```

#{ $.set('codeblock', {codeblock: {contIndent: 6}}) }

```js
const 标题 = "中文与 ASCII 混排的一行代码足够长，在窄版心下需要折行并对齐到网格";
```

全角标点按段落设置挤压：“引号”，（括号）。#style({text: {punct: "none"}})[这一段不挤压：“引号”，（括号）。]
